<div class="g-page">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <header class="g-header">
    <div class="g-container g-nav">
      <a class="g-brand" href="/" aria-label="Big Dream Education home">
        BIG DREAM
        <span>EDUCATION & VISA SERVICES</span>
      </a>

      <nav class="g-navlinks" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/about/">About</a>
        <a href="/services/">Services</a>
        <a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
        <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
        <a class="g-button" href="#consultation">Book a Consultation ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="g-hero">
      <video class="g-hero-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline
        poster="/assets/485-visa-hero.jpg"
        aria-label="Background video for the Temporary Graduate visa page">
        <source src="/services/videos/bigdream_video_under25mb.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
      <div class="g-hero-overlay"></div>

      <div class="g-container g-hero-content">
        <div class="g-breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp; / &nbsp;
          <a href="/services/">Services</a> &nbsp; / &nbsp;
          Subclass 485
        </div>

        <div class="g-eyebrow">Australian Graduate Visa Guidance</div>

        <h1>Your Next Chapter in Australia Starts <span>Here.</span></h1>

        <p>
          Have you recently completed your studies in Australia?
          Understand the Temporary Graduate visa (subclass 485), explore
          the relevant stream and prepare for your next steps with
          guidance from Big Dream Education & Visa Services.
        </p>

        <div class="g-hero-actions">
          <a class="g-button" href="#consultation">Discuss Your Options ↗</a>
          <a class="g-button g-button-outline" href="#visa-streams">Explore Visa Streams ↓</a>
        </div>

        <div class="g-hero-note">
          Eligibility depends on your qualification, visa history and individual circumstances.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HIGHLIGHTS -->
    <div class="g-container g-highlights">
      <div class="g-highlight-grid">
        <div class="g-highlight">
          <strong>After Your Studies</strong>
          <span>Explore post-study visa options</span>
        </div>
        <div class="g-highlight">
          <strong>Different Visa Streams</strong>
          <span>Choose the stream relevant to your qualification</span>
        </div>
        <div class="g-highlight">
          <strong>Application Preparation</strong>
          <span>Understand the requirements before applying</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- INTRODUCTION -->
    <section class="g-section">
      <div class="g-container g-two-col">
        <div class="g-copy g-reveal">
          <div class="g-eyebrow">Understand Subclass 485</div>
          <h2>Make an informed decision about your post-study options.</h2>

          <p>
            The Temporary Graduate visa (subclass 485) is designed for
            eligible international students who have completed qualifying
            studies in Australia. Depending on the stream, it can allow
            eligible graduates to live, work and study in Australia
            temporarily.
          </p>

          <p>
            The right pathway depends on your completed qualification,
            age, current visa status and other requirements. Reviewing
            these details early can help you understand what needs to
            be prepared for your application.
          </p>

          <ul class="g-check-list">
            <li><span class="g-check">✓</span><span>Understand which visa stream may suit your qualification.</span></li>
            <li><span class="g-check">✓</span><span>Review key eligibility and document requirements.</span></li>
            <li><span class="g-check">✓</span><span>Prepare questions before making your application.</span></li>
          </ul>

          <a class="g-button" href="#consultation">Enquire About Subclass 485 ↗</a>
        </div>

        <aside class="g-side-card g-reveal">
          <div class="g-eyebrow">Before You Apply</div>
          <h3>Timing and eligibility matter.</h3>
