          <details class="g-reveal">
            <summary>What is the Temporary Graduate visa (subclass 485)?</summary>
            <p>
              It is a temporary Australian visa for eligible international
              graduates. Depending on the stream, it may allow the holder
              to live, work and study in Australia temporarily.
            </p>
